        "original_id": "9e06b0c7-e9a0-56d2-9e17-5c411f797f69",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John James Capozzi Jr., Tommy Carcetti, Aidan Gillen\n- Roles: District of Columbia Shadow U.S. Representative, at-large member, city council member\n- Organizations: District of Columbia Democratic State Committee\n- Products: The Wire\n- Places: District of Columbia, Baltimore\n\nFacts:\n- John James Capozzi Jr. served as the second District of Columbia Shadow U.S. Representative from 1995 to 1997.\n- John James Capozzi Jr. was an at-large member of the District of Columbia Democratic State Committee for 17 years.\n- John James Capozzi Jr. is considered a possible inspiration for Tommy Carcetti in the HBO drama The Wire.\n- Tommy Carcetti is a fictional character in the HBO drama The Wire.\n- Aidan Gillen played Tommy Carcetti in The Wire.\n- Tommy Carcetti is an ambitious Baltimore politician who begins the series holding a seat on the city council.",
